<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · site</p><h1 class="enc-title">Poiessa</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Poiessa was one of the four ancient cities of the island of Keos in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cyclades">Cyclades</a>, on its west coast. It was the smallest of the Keian tetrapolis, with Ioulis, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/karthaia">Karthaia</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/koressia">Koressia</a>. Its remains include a temple of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/apollo">Apollo</a> Smintheus.</p></div>
